cmhrr6i45004hatz0hx0pdsn5	Leading Change	NON_TECHNICAL	Leadership	Commitment to improving the business, enabling the process of change and transition and leading others to adapt well to change. Knows and uses various change methodologies appropriately at the individual, team and organizational level. Aware of the history of change in OA and is skilled at applying appropriate lessons from past change journey	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.622	2025-11-10 08:48:25.048	NON_-LEAD-001
cmhrr6i4e0060atz0j7jmwzvp	Service Delivery	NON_TECHNICAL	Business Support	Discovers the needs of "Internal" and "External" OA customers and strives to deliver services to meet their needs.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.63	2025-11-10 08:48:25.051	NON_-BUSI-010
cmhrr6i4m007hatz0lpuypbvj	Operational Excellence	NON_TECHNICAL	Business Support	The ability to drive a culture of first time right performance and operational excellence by ensuring the work is error-free, continuous improvement of operations and meeting customer expectations. It includes innovating working methods to enhance the quality of experience.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.638	2025-11-10 08:48:25.054	NON_-BUSI-006
cmhrr6i4s008katz017yezlmp	Analytical Thinking	NON_TECHNICAL	Analytical & Decision-Making	The ability to process large amounts of information in a logical manner, establish connections, cause-and-effect relationships and patterns to address a challenging situation or an issue. includes Integrating theories in practice when addressing challenging situations.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.644	2025-11-10 08:48:25.057	NON_-ANAL-001
cmhrr6i4y009jatz06yafwx9s	Problem Solving	NON_TECHNICAL	Analytical & Decision-Making	The ability to break down a problem or situation into small components, study it from multiple perspectives, anticipate possible obstacles and identify key actions to solve the problem.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.65	2025-11-10 08:48:25.06	NON_-ANAL-003
cmhrr6i5500asatz0qj96mq1t	Leading and Coaching Team	NON_TECHNICAL	Leadership	Drives a high performance culture by empowering team members, effectively delegating work and recognize and appreciate contribution. The ability to understand team members needs and aspirations and an ability to provide constructive feedback to improve their performance at work. It includes acting as a coach and mentor and developing others in realizing their career aspirations.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.657	2025-11-10 08:48:25.063	NON_-LEAD-002
cmhrr6i5c00c5atz0ymfrd7uv	Stakeholder Management(Common)	NON_TECHNICAL	Business Support	Knowledge and understanding of different stakeholders, their needs, priorities and agenda. It includes actively engaging and partnering with them to achieve a common objective.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.665	2025-11-10 08:48:25.066	NON_-BUSI-011
cmhrr6i5j00d6atz0akbl9hlq	Project Management	NON_TECHNICAL	Business Support	Knowledge of the principles, methods, or tools of project management and ability to develop, schedule, coordinate and manage projects and resources. It includes the ability to monitor and inspect costs, work, and contractor performance. In addition, the ability to plan for contingencies and  build them into the project plan.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.671	2025-11-10 08:48:25.069	NON_-BUSI-007
cmhrr6i5q00ehatz0rpnenakg	Negotiation	NON_TECHNICAL	Leadership	Negotiation is the ability to work towards win-win outcomes. \r\nis a dialogue between two or more people or parties intended to reach a beneficial outcome over one or more conflict. Negotiation is an interaction and process between entities who aspire to agree on matters of mutual interest, while optimizing their individual utilities.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.678	2025-11-10 08:48:25.072	NON_-LEAD-003
cmhrr6i6200gnatz08p9azgrn	Innovation and Continuous Improvement	NON_TECHNICAL	Analytical & Decision-Making	Challenging the conventional way of doing things, generating new, innovative ideas, products / services and effective solutions which continually improve performance.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.69	2025-11-10 08:48:25.078	NON_-ANAL-002
cmhrr6i6900i0atz0ns2ufw36	Emotional Intelligence (EI or EQ)	NON_TECHNICAL	Interpersonal Skills	The ability to monitor one’s own and other’s emotions; discriminate between different emotions and label them appropriately; and use emotional information to guide thinking and behavior.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.697	2025-11-10 08:48:25.081	NON_-INTE-003
cmhrr6i6d00ixatz0qrtga8yf	Time Management	NON_TECHNICAL	Interpersonal Skills	The skill of managing time effectively by planning, organizing, and controlling the hours spent on different activities.. Good time management enables to work smarter – not harder – and get more done in less time, even when time is tight and pressures are high. Failing to manage your time damages effectiveness and causes stress.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.702	2025-11-10 08:48:25.084	NON_-INTE-005
cmhrr6i6k00k2atz0kk9w8yo5	Team work	NON_TECHNICAL	Interpersonal Skills	The ability to effectively work with and support others as\r\npart of a team, both within and across functions, and\r\nbuilding and maintaining positive relationships at all levels\r\nwith cultural sensitivity, showing respect & effectively\r\nworking with diversity	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.708	2025-11-10 08:48:25.087	NON_-INTE-004
cmhrr6i7100ncatz0zjebme66	Airport Certification Management	TECHNICAL	Certification & Compliance	Knowledge of international and local requirements to achieve a successful airport certification. Ability of populating and preparing the application and procedures required for certification including Aerodrome Manual, Emergency plan, Safety Management system, Security Program, wildlife plan, Maintenance plan, Fire Manual, as well as Driving Certification Process.	\N	Compliance	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.726	2025-11-10 08:48:25.094	TECH-CERT-002
cmhrr6i3o001latz0jbfjr29m	Drive for Results	NON_TECHNICAL	Business Support	The ability to drive self and team to achieve higher performance standards of excellence, by establishing stretch performance goals and plan and direct the resources to meet those goals.	\N	All Divisions	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:29.604	2025-11-10 08:48:25.041	NON_-BUSI-003
