cmhrr6iub049catz0o8wgxg0r	Airport Resources Management (AOC)	TECHNICAL	Operations	It is the understanding of various airport resources like stands, gates, check-in counters, baggage carousels and an ability to utilize them in an efficient and optimum manner. It includes an understanding of the AOC SOPs and the skill of applying them in day to day operations while ensuring safety. It includes  making the resources available and allocating them in a timely and efficient manner and planning for alternatives in case of contingencies  as well as an understanding of the impact of revenue.	\N	Operations	{}	t	2025-11-09 13:32:30.563	2025-11-10 08:48:25.372	TECH-OPER-003
